    "ORDER MATTERS: levels appear on the map in the order listed here, per world.",
    "The path is a curve (config/worlds.js) — nodes are spread along it at runtime,",
    "so adding or removing a level just re-spaces the others. Never place nodes by hand.",
    "World 2 must contain exactly one level with category 'boss' (the mini-boss); it",
    "always lands on the bossSlot control point and splits that world into two halves.",
    "Optional levels are lifted off the main path and attached to the previous",
    "non-optional level (override with 'anchorAfter').",
    "NO DATES ANYWHERE: the calendar lives outside this file, by design.",
    "All exercise/answer/slide/todo bodies below are PLACEHOLDERS — replace them."
  ],

